{"id":"45d02e8df3a08d98","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md","title":"Knot Diagram","display":"df-knot-diagram — Knot Diagram","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-knot-diagram","aliases":["58-df-knot-diagram","Knot Diagram"],"display":"df-knot-diagram — Knot Diagram","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-regular-knot-projection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-knot-diagram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-knot-diagram</span><span>Knot Diagram</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-knot-diagram — Knot Diagram"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbc0915e0402cd40\" href=\"?note=dbc0915e0402cd40\" title=\"58-df-regular-knot-projection.md\">58-df-regular-knot-projection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,k,q,h,\\pi,o,\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V\">\\(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o,\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1,S^3\">\\(S^1,S^3\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Knot}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Knot}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbc0915e0402cd40\" href=\"?note=dbc0915e0402cd40\" title=\"58-df-regular-knot-projection.md\">58-df-regular-knot-projection.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(u)\">\\(T(u)\\)</span> 是其显式定义的圆周方向导数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 为交叉点的上支选择函数。原有六元接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)\">\\(\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 仍仅为平面支撑集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land q\\in S^3\\setminus k[S^1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\n\\land D=\\gamma[S^1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C=\\{p\\in D:\\exists u,v\\in S^1\\;(\nu\\ne v\\land\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]=\\{u,v\\}\\land\\det[T(u)\\ T(v)]\\ne0)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C)\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall p\\in D\\;\\bigl(|\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]|=1\\lor p\\in C\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(o,C,S^1)\n\\land\\forall p\\in C\\;\\Bigl(o(p)\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\setminus\\{o(p)\\}\\;(z(o(p))&gt;z(u))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land q\\in S^3\\setminus k[S^1]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\n\\land D=\\gamma[S^1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land C=\\{p\\in D:\\exists u,v\\in S^1\\;(\nu\\ne v\\land\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]=\\{u,v\\}\\land\\det[T(u)\\ T(v)]\\ne0)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C)\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall p\\in D\\;\\bigl(|\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]|=1\\lor p\\in C\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(o,C,S^1)\n\\land\\forall p\\in C\\;\\Bigl(o(p)\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\setminus\\{o(p)\\}\\;(z(o(p))&gt;z(u))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>平面支撑集和上支选择函数仍是不同实参；没有为了制作组合图而改动此文件的六元接口。</li>\n<li>每个像点是一点纤维或横截双点，且双点只有有限个。导数的含义及浸入条件不再依赖 Remark。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Adams, The Knot Book</li>\n<li>Cromwell, Embedding Knots and Links in Projective Space</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-knot.md","status":"resolved","id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-knot-projection.md","status":"resolved","id":"dbc0915e0402cd40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-knot-projection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,k,q,h,\\pi,o,\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V$；$S^1,S^3$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-knot-projection.md","status":"resolved","id":"dbc0915e0402cd40","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}$ 使用 [[58-df-regular-knot-projection.md]]；$T(u)$ 是其显式定义的圆周方向导数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,k,q,h,\\pi,o,\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S^1,S^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Knot}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}","display":false},{"tex":"T(u)","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,k,q,h,\\pi,o)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\land q\\in S^3\\setminus k[S^1]\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularProjectionData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{CircleC1Immersion}_{58,S}(\\gamma,T)\n\\land D=\\gamma[S^1]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land C=\\{p\\in D:\\exists u,v\\in S^1\\;(\nu\\ne v\\land\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]=\\{u,v\\}\\land\\det[T(u)\\ T(v)]\\ne0)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(C)\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall p\\in D\\;\\bigl(|\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]|=1\\lor p\\in C\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(o,C,S^1)\n\\land\\forall p\\in C\\;\\Bigl(o(p)\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\gamma^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\setminus\\{o(p)\\}\\;(z(o(p))>z(u))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2082,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,k,P,q,h,\\pi,o,Q,s,t,p,b,A,B,C,e\\in V$。$\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)$ 是下式定义的二元完整图接口；它与 [[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md]] 的平面支撑集实参不同。"},{"id":"d43649881d4bfbbd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (diagram predicate with its projection data, see [[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md]])"},{"id":"0a9a8cb11b4dac7a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-735","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md|58-df-knot-diagram]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["ccaaf599ec318a33","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751","dbc0915e0402cd40","ed44d43cf74ca35e"]}